    "message": "feat(providers): add zenmux, upgrade cline in place, wire tool-turn boundary\n\n- zenmux: new ZenMux gateway provider (structured reasoning details, thinking_boolean_path\n  model list, reasoning_delta fallback field).\n- cline: upgraded in place to upstream's richer profile (DISABLED reasoning replay,\n  structured_reasoning_details, custom /ai/cline/recommended-models list). Kept the\n  `cline` id + CLINE_API_KEY env so existing user configs are unaffected (no rename).\n- OpenAIChatProfile gains reasoning_delta_fallback_field + structured_reasoning_details\n  fields and a fallback-aware reasoning_delta().\n- Wired _close_openai_tool_result_turns into convert_messages (deferred from v5.14.2):\n  a user role following a tool role now gets a synthetic assistant boundary. Two\n  converter tests updated to the new ordering + a new boundary test.\n\nVerification: full suite 3948 passed / 6 pre-existing PS-installer failures (baseline\nunchanged); ruff format/check + ty clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
